  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">Action row + Binding row; the Binding is the ONLY routing config. NO new dispatch endpoint; NO string-key routing. Mirror-first through the core's hoisted description source. Eval cases gate the change. OutputSchemaJson MUST pass OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator — property-level boolean `required` BANNED (the `kind` enum is expressed via the `enum` keyword).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-040">Dispatched output is ledger-written by the seam; no parallel cache.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Engine FROZEN — prompted Action, not a playbook. Consumes the R1 `compose-document` scope.</constraint>
