  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + gate">Load task, project CLAUDE.md, HANDOFF doc, Spike-1 + Spike-6 notes, knowledge files. CONFIRM core Phase A0 published the triple-twin hoist + dispatch seam before authoring.</step>
